# Twilio / WhatsApp

- Twilio credentials are server-only.
- Validate Twilio signatures on every inbound/status webhook before processing.
- Deduplicate by MessageSid/event key.
- Normalize phones to E.164.
- Respect communication preference/consent.
- Use approved WhatsApp templates when provider rules require them.
- Keep message contents out of generic logs.
- Appointment confirmation parsing must be conservative; ambiguous inbound messages do not silently reschedule.

- Reminder scheduling uses Supabase Cron/pg_cron every 5 minutes, invoking the authenticated Next.js job endpoint via pg_net; do not depend on Vercel Cron for sub-daily reminders.
- Use `whatsapp_reminder_outbox` with atomic claims, retry states, and `unique(appointment_id, reminder_type)` before calling Twilio.
- Validate `CRON_SECRET` before the reminder job performs any side effect; the scheduler copy of the secret is stored in Supabase Vault.
